[
 {
  "t0": 0.95,
  "t1": 2.59,
  "text": "What if you woke up tomorrow and your brain"
 },
 {
  "t0": 2.63,
  "t1": 5.7,
  "text": "suddenly unlocked one hundred percent of its full potential?"
 },
 {
  "t0": 5.907,
  "t1": 7.527,
  "text": "You could memorize entire books,"
 },
 {
  "t0": 7.567,
  "t1": 9.667,
  "text": "solve complicated equations in seconds,"
 },
 {
  "t0": 9.707,
  "t1": 11.327,
  "text": "and learn new languages faster than a"
 },
 {
  "t0": 11.367,
  "t1": 13.457,
  "text": "toddler learns to scream in a supermarket."
 },
 {
  "t0": 13.737,
  "t1": 15.467,
  "text": "You might even become smarter than Einstein."
 },
 {
  "t0": 16.8,
  "t1": 18.41,
  "text": "You could predict people's behavior,"
 },
 {
  "t0": 18.5,
  "t1": 20.13,
  "text": "understand complex emotions,"
 },
 {
  "t0": 20.22,
  "t1": 21.2,
  "text": "and solve problems that"
 },
 {
  "t0": 21.24,
  "t1": 23.49,
  "text": "ordinary humans couldn't even imagine."
 },
 {
  "t0": 23.656,
  "t1": 25.886,
  "text": "You'd basically become a walking supercomputer."
 },
 {
  "t0": 26.575,
  "t1": 27.438,
  "text": "Except\u2026"
 },
 {
  "t0": 27.478,
  "t1": 28.678,
  "text": "There's still one problem."
 },
 {
  "t0": 29.219,
  "t1": 30.25,
  "text": "Your girlfriend."
 },
 {
  "t0": 30.29,
  "t1": 32.65,
  "text": "Because no matter how powerful your brain becomes,"
 },
 {
  "t0": 32.69,
  "t1": 34.43,
  "text": "there's one mysterious creature whose messages"
 },
 {
  "t0": 34.47,
  "t1": 37.54,
  "text": "might still crash your entire operating system."
 },
 {
  "t0": 38.8,
  "t1": 40.066,
  "text": "But before we get to that\u2026"
 },
 {
  "t0": 40.106,
  "t1": 41.546,
  "text": "Let's find out what would actually happen"
 },
 {
  "t0": 41.586,
  "t1": 43.956,
  "text": "if your brain reached its maximum potential."
 },
 {
  "t0": 45.75,
  "t1": 46.565,
  "text": "Day one."
 },
 {
  "t0": 46.605,
  "t1": 47.885,
  "text": "You wake up, look at your phone,"
 },
 {
  "t0": 47.925,
  "t1": 49.515,
  "text": "and suddenly remember everything."
 },
 {
  "t0": 49.704,
  "t1": 51.864,
  "text": "Every conversation, every book you've read,"
 },
 {
  "t0": 51.904,
  "t1": 54.274,
  "text": "every password you've forgotten since 2012."
 },
 {
  "t0": 54.466,
  "t1": 56.516,
  "text": "Your memory is now ridiculously powerful."
 },
 {
  "t0": 57.8,
  "t1": 60.23,
  "text": "Normally, your brain constantly filters information,"
 },
 {
  "t0": 60.38,
  "t1": 62.55,
  "text": "keeping some memories and discarding others."
 },
 {
  "t0": 62.743,
  "t1": 63.963,
  "text": "But imagine being able to recall"
 },
 {
  "t0": 64.003,
  "t1": 66.913,
  "text": "almost every detail with incredible accuracy."
 },
 {
  "t0": 68.3,
  "t1": 69.95,
  "text": "You read a three-hundred-page book once."
 },
 {
  "t0": 70.909,
  "t1": 71.561,
  "text": "Done."
 },
 {
  "t0": 71.601,
  "t1": 73.381,
  "text": "You remember the characters, the story,"
 },
 {
  "t0": 73.421,
  "t1": 76.251,
  "text": "and even that suspicious typo on page 147."
 },
 {
  "t0": 77.8,
  "t1": 79.0,
  "text": "You walk into an exam."
 },
 {
  "t0": 79.113,
  "t1": 80.523,
  "text": "The teacher asks a question."
 },
 {
  "t0": 80.788,
  "t1": 81.918,
  "text": "You close your eyes."
 },
 {
  "t0": 81.958,
  "t1": 82.218,
  "text": "And suddenly,"
 },
 {
  "t0": 82.258,
  "t1": 84.668,
  "text": "the entire textbook appears inside your head."
 },
 {
  "t0": 84.724,
  "t1": 86.494,
  "text": "You answer every question perfectly."
 },
 {
  "t0": 86.775,
  "t1": 88.145,
  "text": "Your classmates stare at you."
 },
 {
  "t0": 88.211,
  "t1": 90.141,
  "text": "The teacher starts questioning your existence."
 },
 {
  "t0": 91.25,
  "t1": 92.053,
  "text": "But then\u2026"
 },
 {
  "t0": 92.093,
  "t1": 93.583,
  "text": "Your girlfriend sends you a message."
 },
 {
  "t0": 94.337,
  "t1": 95.3,
  "text": "\"Fine.\""
 },
 {
  "t0": 95.34,
  "t1": 96.54,
  "text": "Just one word."
 },
 {
  "t0": 96.95,
  "t1": 99.02,
  "text": "You immediately activate your upgraded memory."
 },
 {
  "t0": 99.308,
  "t1": 101.738,
  "text": "You search through thousands of previous conversations."
 },
 {
  "t0": 101.983,
  "t1": 104.353,
  "text": "Three months ago, she said \"fine\" with a heart emoji."
 },
 {
  "t0": 104.623,
  "t1": 107.253,
  "text": "Two weeks ago, she said \"fine\" followed by a full stop."
 },
 {
  "t0": 107.502,
  "t1": 107.982,
  "text": "Yesterday,"
 },
 {
  "t0": 108.022,
  "t1": 109.082,
  "text": "she said \"fine\" after you"
 },
 {
  "t0": 109.122,
  "t1": 110.892,
  "text": "forgot to compliment her new haircut."
 },
 {
  "t0": 111.102,
  "t1": 113.582,
  "text": "You analyze the punctuation, message timing,"
 },
 {
  "t0": 113.622,
  "t1": 115.652,
  "text": "previous arguments, and even the weather."
 },
 {
  "t0": 115.757,
  "t1": 117.587,
  "text": "After seventeen minutes of calculations,"
 },
 {
  "t0": 117.797,
  "t1": 119.407,
  "text": "your brain produces a result."
 },
 {
  "t0": 119.511,
  "t1": 121.401,
  "text": "Danger level: 98.7 percent."
 },
 {
  "t0": 122.8,
  "t1": 124.0,
  "text": "You reply:"
 },
 {
  "t0": 124.121,
  "t1": 124.945,
  "text": "\"Are you sure?\""
 },
 {
  "t0": 124.985,
  "t1": 126.185,
  "text": "She replies:"
 },
 {
  "t0": 126.486,
  "t1": 127.686,
  "text": "\"Whatever.\""
 },
 {
  "t0": 127.932,
  "t1": 129.132,
  "text": "Your brain crashes."
 },
 {
  "t0": 129.687,
  "t1": 130.887,
  "text": "Congratulations."
 },
 {
  "t0": 131.069,
  "t1": 133.479,
  "text": "You can remember the entire history of humanity,"
 },
 {
  "t0": 133.549,
  "t1": 133.849,
  "text": "but apparently,"
 },
 {
  "t0": 133.889,
  "t1": 137.179,
  "text": "you still need a PhD in girlfriend communication."
 },
 {
  "t0": 139.3,
  "t1": 140.5,
  "text": "Next, your thinking speed."
 },
 {
  "t0": 140.689,
  "t1": 141.869,
  "text": "Your brain processes enormous"
 },
 {
  "t0": 141.909,
  "t1": 143.969,
  "text": "amounts of information every second,"
 },
 {
  "t0": 144.009,
  "t1": 144.889,
  "text": "but conscious thinking and"
 },
 {
  "t0": 144.929,
  "t1": 146.619,
  "text": "decision-making have their own limitations."
 },
 {
  "t0": 147.452,
  "t1": 149.392,
  "text": "Now imagine your brain becoming incredibly"
 },
 {
  "t0": 149.432,
  "t1": 152.722,
  "text": "efficient at recognizing patterns and connecting information."
 },
 {
  "t0": 153.085,
  "t1": 154.355,
  "text": "Let's test this with chess."
 },
 {
  "t0": 154.481,
  "t1": 155.741,
  "text": "An ordinary player looks at the"
 },
 {
  "t0": 155.781,
  "t1": 158.071,
  "text": "board and considers a few possible moves."
 },
 {
  "t0": 158.296,
  "t1": 159.896,
  "text": "A professional chess player can recognize"
 },
 {
  "t0": 159.936,
  "t1": 163.506,
  "text": "familiar patterns and anticipate several possible responses."
 },
 {
  "t0": 163.823,
  "t1": 165.243,
  "text": "But with your upgraded brain?"
 },
 {
  "t0": 165.283,
  "t1": 167.813,
  "text": "You examine the board, calculate possible strategies,"
 },
 {
  "t0": 168.003,
  "t1": 169.183,
  "text": "and predict your opponent's mistakes"
 },
 {
  "t0": 169.223,
  "t1": 171.093,
  "text": "before they even touch a piece."
 },
 {
  "t0": 171.291,
  "t1": 172.501,
  "text": "Your opponent moves a pawn."
 },
 {
  "t0": 172.749,
  "t1": 173.63,
  "text": "You smile."
 },
 {
  "t0": 173.67,
  "t1": 174.98,
  "text": "Checkmate in twelve moves."
 },
 {
  "t0": 175.137,
  "t1": 176.223,
  "text": "He starts sweating."
 },
 {
  "t0": 176.263,
  "t1": 177.463,
  "text": "Then he asks for a rematch."
 },
 {
  "t0": 177.657,
  "t1": 179.307,
  "text": "You calculate another twelve moves."
 },
 {
  "t0": 179.499,
  "t1": 181.389,
  "text": "He starts questioning his career choices."
 },
 {
  "t0": 181.635,
  "t1": 182.315,
  "text": "At this point,"
 },
 {
  "t0": 182.355,
  "t1": 184.505,
  "text": "even a chess computer might need a coffee break."
 },
 {
  "t0": 184.663,
  "t1": 185.743,
  "text": "Feeling unstoppable,"
 },
 {
  "t0": 185.783,
  "t1": 186.523,
  "text": "you decide to test your"
 },
 {
  "t0": 186.563,
  "t1": 188.793,
  "text": "processing speed on something even harder."
 },
 {
  "t0": 189.001,
  "t1": 190.133,
  "text": "Your girlfriend asks:"
 },
 {
  "t0": 190.173,
  "t1": 191.703,
  "text": "\"Do you think I look fat in this dress?\""
 },
 {
  "t0": 191.93,
  "t1": 192.71,
  "text": "Your brain immediately"
 },
 {
  "t0": 192.75,
  "t1": 194.94,
  "text": "activates every available processor."
 },
 {
  "t0": 195.214,
  "t1": 197.734,
  "text": "You calculate her facial expression, the dress design,"
 },
 {
  "t0": 197.774,
  "t1": 200.314,
  "text": "previous conversations, emotional context,"
 },
 {
  "t0": 200.354,
  "t1": 202.644,
  "text": "and the possible consequences of every answer."
 },
 {
  "t0": 202.84,
  "t1": 204.04,
  "text": "Option A: Tell the truth."
 },
 {
  "t0": 204.179,
  "t1": 205.729,
  "text": "Option B: Say she looks beautiful."
 },
 {
  "t0": 205.987,
  "t1": 208.117,
  "text": "Option C: Pretend you didn't hear the question."
 },
 {
  "t0": 208.302,
  "t1": 210.712,
  "text": "Your brain simulates ten million possible outcomes."
 },
 {
  "t0": 210.958,
  "t1": 212.768,
  "text": "And finally, it chooses option B."
 },
 {
  "t0": 212.895,
  "t1": 213.952,
  "text": "\"You look beautiful.\""
 },
 {
  "t0": 213.992,
  "t1": 215.016,
  "text": "She responds:"
 },
 {
  "t0": 215.056,
  "t1": 216.866,
  "text": "\"So you're saying I looked ugly yesterday?\""
 },
 {
  "t0": 217.06,
  "t1": 218.088,
  "text": "System error."
 },
 {
  "t0": 218.128,
  "t1": 219.328,
  "text": "No solution found."
 },
 {
  "t0": 220.3,
  "t1": 222.01,
  "text": "But how smart could you actually become?"
 },
 {
  "t0": 222.152,
  "t1": 223.442,
  "text": "Let's talk about Albert Einstein."
 },
 {
  "t0": 223.788,
  "t1": 224.848,
  "text": "Einstein is famous for"
 },
 {
  "t0": 224.888,
  "t1": 226.638,
  "text": "developing the theory of relativity,"
 },
 {
  "t0": 226.728,
  "t1": 227.968,
  "text": "which completely changed how"
 },
 {
  "t0": 228.008,
  "t1": 230.318,
  "text": "scientists understand space and time."
 },
 {
  "t0": 230.522,
  "t1": 231.952,
  "text": "But here's the interesting part."
 },
 {
  "t0": 232.028,
  "t1": 233.788,
  "text": "There is no scientific evidence that Einstein"
 },
 {
  "t0": 233.828,
  "t1": 236.658,
  "text": "used only a certain percentage of his brain."
 },
 {
  "t0": 236.852,
  "t1": 238.292,
  "text": "His intelligence wasn't caused by"
 },
 {
  "t0": 238.332,
  "t1": 240.342,
  "text": "unlocking a secret brain region."
 },
 {
  "t0": 240.488,
  "t1": 242.968,
  "text": "It involved extraordinary mathematical thinking,"
 },
 {
  "t0": 243.008,
  "t1": 246.338,
  "text": "imagination, curiosity, and years of scientific work."
 },
 {
  "t0": 246.46,
  "t1": 248.36,
  "text": "So, if you had an optimized brain,"
 },
 {
  "t0": 248.4,
  "t1": 250.11,
  "text": "would you automatically become Einstein?"
 },
 {
  "t0": 250.488,
  "t1": 251.666,
  "text": "Not necessarily."
 },
 {
  "t0": 251.706,
  "t1": 253.506,
  "text": "Having a powerful computer doesn't mean you"
 },
 {
  "t0": 253.546,
  "t1": 255.856,
  "text": "automatically know how to build a spaceship."
 },
 {
  "t0": 255.93,
  "t1": 258.06,
  "text": "You still need knowledge, experience, and practice."
 },
 {
  "t0": 258.353,
  "t1": 258.773,
  "text": "Although,"
 },
 {
  "t0": 258.813,
  "t1": 259.593,
  "text": "at least now you could"
 },
 {
  "t0": 259.633,
  "t1": 261.723,
  "text": "understand why your computer keeps crashing."
 },
 {
  "t0": 261.981,
  "t1": 264.211,
  "text": "But imagine Einstein had your upgraded brain."
 },
 {
  "t0": 264.428,
  "t1": 265.728,
  "text": "He could spend years calculating"
 },
 {
  "t0": 265.768,
  "t1": 267.518,
  "text": "the mysteries of the universe."
 },
 {
  "t0": 267.779,
  "t1": 269.449,
  "text": "Developing complicated equations."
 },
 {
  "t0": 269.796,
  "t1": 271.666,
  "text": "Understanding the nature of time and space."
 },
 {
  "t0": 271.902,
  "t1": 273.792,
  "text": "And then his girlfriend walks into the room."
 },
 {
  "t0": 273.93,
  "t1": 275.4,
  "text": "\"Baby, what are you thinking about?\""
 },
 {
  "t0": 275.483,
  "t1": 276.833,
  "text": "\"The curvature of spacetime.\""
 },
 {
  "t0": 276.981,
  "t1": 278.751,
  "text": "\"Okay. So you're not thinking about me?\""
 },
 {
  "t0": 278.821,
  "t1": 280.611,
  "text": "Einstein might have understood the universe."
 },
 {
  "t0": 280.91,
  "t1": 283.44,
  "text": "But explaining why he didn't text back for three hours?"
 },
 {
  "t0": 283.624,
  "t1": 285.214,
  "text": "That's a different theory of relativity."
 },
 {
  "t0": 286.3,
  "t1": 288.75,
  "text": "Now let's move from laboratories to the sports field."
 },
 {
  "t0": 288.935,
  "t1": 290.705,
  "text": "Imagine becoming a professional athlete."
 },
 {
  "t0": 290.883,
  "t1": 293.383,
  "text": "Do Olympic athletes use one hundred"
 },
 {
  "t0": 293.423,
  "t1": 294.496,
  "text": "and fifty percent of their brains?"
 },
 {
  "t0": 294.536,
  "t1": 295.466,
  "text": "Of course not."
 },
 {
  "t0": 295.506,
  "t1": 296.186,
  "text": "There is no special"
 },
 {
  "t0": 296.226,
  "t1": 298.216,
  "text": "brain-power percentage for professional athletes."
 },
 {
  "t0": 298.925,
  "t1": 300.085,
  "text": "Their advantage comes from years"
 },
 {
  "t0": 300.125,
  "t1": 301.975,
  "text": "of training that improve coordination,"
 },
 {
  "t0": 302.285,
  "t1": 304.115,
  "text": "timing, reaction, and decision-making."
 },
 {
  "t0": 304.669,
  "t1": 305.919,
  "text": "Take a professional goalkeeper."
 },
 {
  "t0": 306.178,
  "t1": 307.988,
  "text": "When a striker prepares to kick a football,"
 },
 {
  "t0": 308.038,
  "t1": 309.338,
  "text": "the goalkeeper doesn't simply wait"
 },
 {
  "t0": 309.378,
  "t1": 310.688,
  "text": "for the ball to arrive."
 },
 {
  "t0": 310.851,
  "t1": 313.521,
  "text": "Their brain uses visual information, body position,"
 },
 {
  "t0": 313.591,
  "t1": 313.831,
  "text": "movement,"
 },
 {
  "t0": 313.871,
  "t1": 316.921,
  "text": "and experience to anticipate where the ball might go."
 },
 {
  "t0": 317.01,
  "t1": 318.37,
  "text": "Now imagine your brain processing"
 },
 {
  "t0": 318.41,
  "t1": 320.42,
  "text": "those patterns much more efficiently."
 },
 {
  "t0": 320.697,
  "t1": 322.447,
  "text": "A football flies toward your face."
 },
 {
  "t0": 322.661,
  "t1": 323.633,
  "text": "You move your head."
 },
 {
  "t0": 323.673,
  "t1": 325.383,
  "text": "The ball misses by a few centimeters."
 },
 {
  "t0": 325.679,
  "t1": 326.909,
  "text": "You catch it with one hand."
 },
 {
  "t0": 327.018,
  "t1": 328.159,
  "text": "Your friends are shocked."
 },
 {
  "t0": 328.199,
  "t1": 329.373,
  "text": "You look at them and say\u2026"
 },
 {
  "t0": 329.413,
  "t1": 330.576,
  "text": "\"That was calculated.\""
 },
 {
  "t0": 330.616,
  "t1": 332.306,
  "text": "Then someone throws a pillow at you."
 },
 {
  "t0": 332.37,
  "t1": 333.313,
  "text": "You dodge it."
 },
 {
  "t0": 333.353,
  "t1": 334.553,
  "text": "Someone throws another."
 },
 {
  "t0": 334.615,
  "t1": 335.771,
  "text": "You dodge that too."
 },
 {
  "t0": 335.811,
  "t1": 338.561,
  "text": "Suddenly, your entire family is testing your reflexes."
 },
 {
  "t0": 338.639,
  "t1": 339.839,
  "text": "Congratulations."
 },
 {
  "t0": 340.021,
  "t1": 341.591,
  "text": "You've become the household goalkeeper."
 },
 {
  "t0": 341.823,
  "t1": 344.373,
  "text": "But your girlfriend decides to test your reflexes too."
 },
 {
  "t0": 344.532,
  "t1": 345.587,
  "text": "She suddenly asks:"
 },
 {
  "t0": 345.627,
  "t1": 347.357,
  "text": "\"Do you remember what day today is?\""
 },
 {
  "t0": 347.499,
  "t1": 348.829,
  "text": "Your brain scans the calendar."
 },
 {
  "t0": 349.053,
  "t1": 350.137,
  "text": "Anniversaries."
 },
 {
  "t0": 350.177,
  "t1": 351.073,
  "text": "Birthdays."
 },
 {
  "t0": 351.113,
  "t1": 352.027,
  "text": "First dates."
 },
 {
  "t0": 352.067,
  "t1": 353.193,
  "text": "The day you first met."
 },
 {
  "t0": 353.233,
  "t1": 354.743,
  "text": "The day she first called you handsome."
 },
 {
  "t0": 354.96,
  "t1": 357.55,
  "text": "Within milliseconds, you identify the correct answer."
 },
 {
  "t0": 357.74,
  "t1": 358.94,
  "text": "You smile confidently."
 },
 {
  "t0": 359.143,
  "t1": 360.853,
  "text": "\"Of course. It's our six-month anniversary.\""
 },
 {
  "t0": 361.104,
  "t1": 362.238,
  "text": "She stares at you."
 },
 {
  "t0": 362.278,
  "t1": 363.478,
  "text": "\"It's our seven-month anniversary.\""
 },
 {
  "t0": 363.984,
  "t1": 365.314,
  "text": "Your reflexes were perfect."
 },
 {
  "t0": 365.465,
  "t1": 366.995,
  "text": "Your survival instincts were not."
 },
 {
  "t0": 367.8,
  "t1": 368.46,
  "text": "But perhaps your greatest"
 },
 {
  "t0": 368.5,
  "t1": 370.49,
  "text": "power isn't memory or reaction."
 },
 {
  "t0": 370.759,
  "t1": 371.686,
  "text": "It's learning."
 },
 {
  "t0": 371.726,
  "t1": 374.076,
  "text": "Your brain has something called neuroplasticity."
 },
 {
  "t0": 374.137,
  "t1": 376.177,
  "text": "This is the ability of your brain to change and"
 },
 {
  "t0": 376.217,
  "t1": 379.767,
  "text": "reorganize its connections as you learn and experience new things."
 },
 {
  "t0": 380.015,
  "t1": 382.499,
  "text": "Every time you practice something, your brain adapts."
 },
 {
  "t0": 382.539,
  "t1": 384.009,
  "text": "Think about learning a new language."
 },
 {
  "t0": 384.226,
  "t1": 386.816,
  "text": "Normally, you struggle with pronunciation, grammar,"
 },
 {
  "t0": 386.866,
  "t1": 388.196,
  "text": "and remembering vocabulary."
 },
 {
  "t0": 388.602,
  "t1": 389.622,
  "text": "You spend hours trying to"
 },
 {
  "t0": 389.662,
  "t1": 391.282,
  "text": "understand the difference between \"their\","
 },
 {
  "t0": 391.322,
  "t1": 392.282,
  "text": "\"there\", and \"they're\"."
 },
 {
  "t0": 392.322,
  "t1": 394.392,
  "text": "Your brain starts questioning your life choices."
 },
 {
  "t0": 394.705,
  "t1": 396.515,
  "text": "But imagine learning much more efficiently."
 },
 {
  "t0": 396.798,
  "t1": 398.778,
  "text": "You recognize patterns in sentences,"
 },
 {
  "t0": 398.818,
  "t1": 400.818,
  "text": "connect new words with existing knowledge,"
 },
 {
  "t0": 400.858,
  "t1": 403.108,
  "text": "and improve your pronunciation through practice."
 },
 {
  "t0": 403.324,
  "t1": 404.744,
  "text": "You could become conversational in"
 },
 {
  "t0": 404.784,
  "t1": 406.334,
  "text": "a new language much faster."
 },
 {
  "t0": 406.54,
  "t1": 408.27,
  "text": "You walk into a Japanese restaurant."
 },
 {
  "t0": 408.47,
  "t1": 409.98,
  "text": "You confidently order your food."
 },
 {
  "t0": 410.099,
  "t1": 411.589,
  "text": "The waiter responds in Japanese."
 },
 {
  "t0": 411.893,
  "t1": 413.093,
  "text": "You understand everything."
 },
 {
  "t0": 413.212,
  "t1": 415.222,
  "text": "Then he asks whether you want extra wasabi."
 },
 {
  "t0": 415.413,
  "t1": 416.963,
  "text": "Your brain processes the information."
 },
 {
  "t0": 417.33,
  "t1": 418.74,
  "text": "You confidently say yes."
 },
 {
  "t0": 418.866,
  "t1": 421.296,
  "text": "Five seconds later, your entire face turns red."
 },
 {
  "t0": 421.386,
  "t1": 423.736,
  "text": "Apparently, intelligence doesn't protect your tongue."
 },
 {
  "t0": 423.858,
  "t1": 424.89,
  "text": "But that's not all."
 },
 {
  "t0": 424.93,
  "t1": 427.0,
  "text": "You decide to learn the language of relationships."
 },
 {
  "t0": 427.377,
  "t1": 429.507,
  "text": "You study psychology, emotional intelligence,"
 },
 {
  "t0": 429.657,
  "t1": 432.347,
  "text": "facial expressions, body language, and communication."
 },
 {
  "t0": 432.684,
  "t1": 434.354,
  "text": "You analyze thousands of conversations."
 },
 {
  "t0": 434.793,
  "t1": 436.763,
  "text": "You build a database of emotional patterns."
 },
 {
  "t0": 437.062,
  "t1": 438.772,
  "text": "Finally, you think you've cracked the code."
 },
 {
  "t0": 438.906,
  "t1": 440.036,
  "text": "Your girlfriend says:"
 },
 {
  "t0": 440.076,
  "t1": 441.069,
  "text": "\"Nothing's wrong.\""
 },
 {
  "t0": 441.109,
  "t1": 442.319,
  "text": "You confidently respond:"
 },
 {
  "t0": 442.532,
  "t1": 444.412,
  "text": "\"Based on your facial expression, tone,"
 },
 {
  "t0": 444.452,
  "t1": 447.002,
  "text": "and previous behavior, I believe something is wrong.\""
 },
 {
  "t0": 447.147,
  "t1": 448.144,
  "text": "She looks at you."
 },
 {
  "t0": 448.184,
  "t1": 450.034,
  "text": "\"Wow. So now I'm not allowed to have feelings?\""
 },
 {
  "t0": 450.275,
  "t1": 452.245,
  "text": "You have successfully learned twelve languages."
 },
 {
  "t0": 452.513,
  "t1": 453.173,
  "text": "But the language of"
 },
 {
  "t0": 453.213,
  "t1": 455.243,
  "text": "\"nothing's wrong\" remains undocumented."
 },
 {
  "t0": 456.3,
  "t1": 457.73,
  "text": "But there's one tiny problem."
 },
 {
  "t0": 457.894,
  "t1": 459.904,
  "text": "Your brain is already an energy-hungry organ."
 },
 {
  "t0": 460.32,
  "t1": 461.5,
  "text": "Although it makes up only about"
 },
 {
  "t0": 461.54,
  "t1": 463.08,
  "text": "two percent of your body weight,"
 },
 {
  "t0": 463.12,
  "t1": 464.4,
  "text": "it uses roughly twenty percent"
 },
 {
  "t0": 464.44,
  "t1": 466.03,
  "text": "of your body's energy at rest."
 },
 {
  "t0": 466.226,
  "t1": 467.686,
  "text": "That's a lot of electricity for something"
 },
 {
  "t0": 467.726,
  "t1": 470.776,
  "text": "that sometimes forgets why you opened the refrigerator."
 },
 {
  "t0": 471.055,
  "t1": 472.275,
  "text": "Now imagine making your brain"
 },
 {
  "t0": 472.315,
  "t1": 474.685,
  "text": "work even more efficiently and intensely."
 },
 {
  "t0": 474.961,
  "t1": 477.761,
  "text": "Your body still needs oxygen, glucose, blood flow,"
 },
 {
  "t0": 477.801,
  "t1": 478.641,
  "text": "and the right balance of"
 },
 {
  "t0": 478.681,
  "t1": 480.711,
  "text": "chemicals to keep everything functioning."
 },
 {
  "t0": 480.889,
  "t1": 482.129,
  "text": "You can't just turn your brain into a"
 },
 {
  "t0": 482.169,
  "t1": 484.739,
  "text": "supercomputer and expect your body to keep up."
 },
 {
  "t0": 484.906,
  "t1": 486.706,
  "text": "You might need more energy, better sleep,"
 },
 {
  "t0": 486.746,
  "t1": 487.946,
  "text": "and plenty of recovery."
 },
 {
  "t0": 488.052,
  "t1": 488.552,
  "text": "And no,"
 },
 {
  "t0": 488.592,
  "t1": 489.912,
  "text": "drinking seventeen energy drinks"
 },
 {
  "t0": 489.952,
  "t1": 491.342,
  "text": "won't turn you into Einstein."
 },
 {
  "t0": 491.718,
  "t1": 492.738,
  "text": "It will probably just turn"
 },
 {
  "t0": 492.778,
  "t1": 494.468,
  "text": "your heart into a washing machine."
 },
 {
  "t0": 494.625,
  "t1": 496.755,
  "text": "Meanwhile, your girlfriend sends another message."
 },
 {
  "t0": 496.964,
  "t1": 497.829,
  "text": "\"Can we talk?\""
 },
 {
  "t0": 497.869,
  "t1": 498.589,
  "text": "Your brain immediately"
 },
 {
  "t0": 498.629,
  "t1": 500.839,
  "text": "activates every available resource."
 },
 {
  "t0": 501.106,
  "t1": 503.576,
  "text": "The memory system starts reviewing your past mistakes."
 },
 {
  "t0": 503.789,
  "t1": 506.159,
  "text": "The emotional system detects possible danger."
 },
 {
  "t0": 506.433,
  "t1": 508.883,
  "text": "The reasoning system calculates possible outcomes."
 },
 {
  "t0": 509.13,
  "t1": 510.34,
  "text": "Your body starts sweating."
 },
 {
  "t0": 510.547,
  "t1": 511.907,
  "text": "Your brain is now using more"
 },
 {
  "t0": 511.947,
  "t1": 514.397,
  "text": "processing power than a NASA supercomputer."
 },
 {
  "t0": 514.561,
  "t1": 515.463,
  "text": "And all of this\u2026"
 },
 {
  "t0": 515.503,
  "t1": 517.134,
  "text": "For a conversation that starts with:"
 },
 {
  "t0": 517.174,
  "t1": 518.924,
  "text": "\"Why did you like her Instagram picture?\""
 },
 {
  "t0": 520.3,
  "t1": 522.15,
  "text": "And here's where things get really interesting."
 },
 {
  "t0": 522.378,
  "t1": 524.138,
  "text": "What if you literally forced one hundred"
 },
 {
  "t0": 524.178,
  "t1": 526.328,
  "text": "percent of your neurons to fire simultaneously?"
 },
 {
  "t0": 526.792,
  "t1": 527.952,
  "text": "Would you become a god?"
 },
 {
  "t0": 527.992,
  "t1": 529.105,
  "text": "Absolutely not."
 },
 {
  "t0": 529.145,
  "t1": 531.035,
  "text": "Your brain doesn't work like a light switch."
 },
 {
  "t0": 531.256,
  "t1": 533.716,
  "text": "Different groups of neurons perform different jobs,"
 },
 {
  "t0": 533.756,
  "t1": 535.456,
  "text": "communicating through carefully coordinated"
 },
 {
  "t0": 535.496,
  "t1": 537.746,
  "text": "electrical and chemical signals."
 },
 {
  "t0": 537.948,
  "t1": 539.858,
  "text": "Think of your brain as a massive orchestra."
 },
 {
  "t0": 540.086,
  "t1": 541.446,
  "text": "The violin, drums, piano,"
 },
 {
  "t0": 541.486,
  "t1": 543.116,
  "text": "and trumpet all have different roles."
 },
 {
  "t0": 543.333,
  "t1": 545.673,
  "text": "Now imagine forcing every musician to play as"
 },
 {
  "t0": 545.713,
  "t1": 548.463,
  "text": "loudly as possible at exactly the same time."
 },
 {
  "t0": 548.578,
  "t1": 549.489,
  "text": "No rhythm."
 },
 {
  "t0": 549.529,
  "t1": 550.729,
  "text": "No coordination."
 },
 {
  "t0": 550.862,
  "t1": 551.857,
  "text": "Just noise."
 },
 {
  "t0": 551.897,
  "t1": 553.097,
  "text": "That's not intelligence."
 },
 {
  "t0": 553.234,
  "t1": 554.434,
  "text": "That's a musical disaster."
 },
 {
  "t0": 554.689,
  "t1": 555.389,
  "text": "In reality,"
 },
 {
  "t0": 555.429,
  "t1": 557.749,
  "text": "uncontrolled synchronized electrical activity in"
 },
 {
  "t0": 557.789,
  "t1": 559.299,
  "text": "the brain can cause seizures."
 },
 {
  "t0": 559.544,
  "t1": 562.194,
  "text": "So the goal isn't to make every neuron fire at once."
 },
 {
  "t0": 562.396,
  "t1": 563.096,
  "text": "It's to make the right"
 },
 {
  "t0": 563.136,
  "t1": 565.286,
  "text": "neurons communicate at the right time."
 },
 {
  "t0": 565.473,
  "t1": 566.473,
  "text": "And this is exactly what"
 },
 {
  "t0": 566.513,
  "t1": 568.123,
  "text": "happens when your girlfriend says:"
 },
 {
  "t0": 568.292,
  "t1": 569.277,
  "text": "\"We need to talk.\""
 },
 {
  "t0": 569.317,
  "t1": 570.657,
  "text": "Your memory starts playing every"
 },
 {
  "t0": 570.697,
  "t1": 572.667,
  "text": "argument from the last five years."
 },
 {
  "t0": 572.874,
  "t1": 573.874,
  "text": "Your imagination creates"
 },
 {
  "t0": 573.914,
  "t1": 576.144,
  "text": "seventeen different disaster scenarios."
 },
 {
  "t0": 576.402,
  "t1": 578.912,
  "text": "Your reasoning tries to identify what you did wrong."
 },
 {
  "t0": 579.03,
  "t1": 580.7,
  "text": "Your emotional system activates."
 },
 {
  "t0": 580.908,
  "t1": 581.748,
  "text": "And your entire brain"
 },
 {
  "t0": 581.788,
  "t1": 584.278,
  "text": "becomes one giant emergency meeting."
 },
 {
  "t0": 584.427,
  "t1": 585.627,
  "text": "All neurons are working."
 },
 {
  "t0": 585.723,
  "t1": 586.923,
  "text": "None of them has a solution."
 },
 {
  "t0": 587.8,
  "t1": 588.18,
  "text": "So,"
 },
 {
  "t0": 588.22,
  "t1": 590.02,
  "text": "would unlocking one hundred percent of your"
 },
 {
  "t0": 590.06,
  "t1": 591.93,
  "text": "brain make you the smartest human alive?"
 },
 {
  "t0": 592.146,
  "t1": 593.288,
  "text": "Not automatically."
 },
 {
  "t0": 593.328,
  "t1": 595.038,
  "text": "Because intelligence isn't a percentage."
 },
 {
  "t0": 595.387,
  "t1": 597.787,
  "text": "It's a combination of memory, learning, reasoning,"
 },
 {
  "t0": 597.827,
  "t1": 599.327,
  "text": "creativity, experience,"
 },
 {
  "t0": 599.367,
  "t1": 601.677,
  "text": "and how efficiently your brain uses information."
 },
 {
  "t0": 601.973,
  "t1": 603.963,
  "text": "Einstein didn't need a secret brain switch."
 },
 {
  "t0": 604.175,
  "t1": 605.255,
  "text": "Professional athletes didn't"
 },
 {
  "t0": 605.295,
  "t1": 606.865,
  "text": "unlock hidden brain regions."
 },
 {
  "t0": 607.122,
  "t1": 609.702,
  "text": "They developed extraordinary abilities through practice,"
 },
 {
  "t0": 609.742,
  "t1": 611.072,
  "text": "experience, and dedication."
 },
 {
  "t0": 611.473,
  "t1": 613.223,
  "text": "And perhaps the greatest lesson is this:"
 },
 {
  "t0": 613.37,
  "t1": 615.71,
  "text": "You might be able to solve complicated equations,"
 },
 {
  "t0": 615.75,
  "t1": 616.97,
  "text": "memorize thousands of books,"
 },
 {
  "t0": 617.01,
  "t1": 618.62,
  "text": "predict the movement of a football,"
 },
 {
  "t0": 618.69,
  "t1": 620.72,
  "text": "and understand the mysteries of the universe."
 },
 {
  "t0": 620.959,
  "t1": 622.319,
  "text": "But when your girlfriend says:"
 },
 {
  "t0": 622.359,
  "t1": 623.545,
  "text": "\"Do whatever you want.\""
 },
 {
  "t0": 623.585,
  "t1": 626.075,
  "text": "Even a supercomputer might need professional help."
 },
 {
  "t0": 626.202,
  "t1": 628.432,
  "text": "Because you can study the human brain for decades."
 },
 {
  "t0": 628.705,
  "t1": 630.055,
  "text": "You can understand the universe."
 },
 {
  "t0": 630.32,
  "t1": 632.47,
  "text": "You can calculate the distance between galaxies."
 },
 {
  "t0": 632.813,
  "t1": 633.866,
  "text": "But sometimes\u2026"
 },
 {
  "t0": 633.906,
  "t1": 635.236,
  "text": "The hardest problem isn't science."
 },
 {
  "t0": 635.745,
  "t1": 636.975,
  "text": "It's deciding where to eat."
 },
 {
  "t0": 637.109,
  "t1": 638.499,
  "text": "See you in the next experiment!"
 }
]